{"seq":7,"slug":"data-ethics-privacy","title":"数据伦理与隐私","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":17,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.23,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 数据伦理与隐私 简介\n\n数据伦理与隐私保护是数据科学实践中不可回避的核心议题。随着数据收集规模的扩大和算法决策的普及，数据使用中的伦理问题日益突出。从算法歧视到隐私泄露，从数据滥用到AI偏见，这些问题不仅涉及法律合规，更关系到技术的社会责任。\n\n本知识库系统讲解数据伦理、隐私法规和负责任AI的核心知识，面向数据科学家、隐私工程师和需要处理用户数据的技术人员。\n\n第1章**数据伦理基础**建立数据伦理的认知框架，介绍核心伦理原则、算法公平性和伦理决策方法。\n\n第2章**隐私法规**系统梳理全球主要隐私法规的要求，涵盖GDPR、全球隐私法规概览和行业隐私标准。\n\n第3章**隐私工程**聚焦隐私保护的技术实现，讲解隐私设计理念、匿名化技术和差分隐私等前沿技术。\n\n第4章**负责任AI**从AI系统的角度探讨伦理实践，包括AI透明性、问责制和治理框架的构建。\n\n建议读者将本知识库作为数据科学实践的伦理指南，在项目的各个阶段参考相关章节，将伦理意识融入日常工作。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ethics-fundamentals","title":"数据伦理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/ethics-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-ethics-principles","title":"数据伦理原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/ethics-fundamentals/data-ethics-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithmic-fairness","title":"算法公平性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/ethics-fundamentals/algorithmic-fairness"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ethical-decision-framework","title":"伦理决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/ethics-fundamentals/ethical-decision-framework"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"privacy-regulations","title":"隐私法规","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-regulations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gdpr-overview","title":"GDPR 核心条款解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-regulations/gdpr-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-privacy-landscape","title":"全球隐私法规概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/privacy-regulations/global-privacy-la